references:
  - type: software
    title: "Petals: Collaborative Inference and Fine-tuning of Large Models"
    abstract: >-
      Referenced as the closest prior system in the distributed-inference
      space. Petals shards a single large model across participants; Swarmbly
      is contrasted against it because it shards the problem instead. Listed
      here for orientation; the authoritative bibliography with full author
      lists and identifiers is REFERENCES.md in this project.
    authors:
      - name: "The Petals project contributors"
    notes: >-
